# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so this is an allowlist. Everything is
# excluded and only what the build needs comes back. A new file at the root
# stays out of the image until someone adds it here. The old form was a
# denylist, which meant every secret and every scratch file had to be
# remembered one at a time.
**

!src/**
!alembic/**
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Re-including a directory re-includes everything under it.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*.bak
